zh-tech-writing

This project was designed after reviewing public approaches to Chinese
technical writing and faithful Chinese revision, including the MIT-licensed
projects https://github.com/luoling8192/technical-writing and
https://github.com/LifelongLazyLearner/qu-ai-wei.

The initial implementation uses independently written instructions and
synthetic evaluation cases. It does not include copied private documents or
upstream source text. If a future change incorporates a substantial portion of
an upstream work, preserve the applicable copyright and license notice with
that change.
